@@ -1499,9 +1493,7 @@ .Sx ENVIRONMENT ,
 above.
 .Pp
 .It Pa ~/.ssh/id_ecdsa
-.It Pa ~/.ssh/id_ecdsa_sk
 .It Pa ~/.ssh/id_ed25519
-.It Pa ~/.ssh/id_ed25519_sk
 .It Pa ~/.ssh/id_mldsa44_ed25519
 .It Pa ~/.ssh/id_rsa
 Contains the private key for authentication.
@@ -1515,9 +1507,7 @@ generating the key which will be used to
 sensitive part of this file using AES-128.
 .Pp
 .It Pa ~/.ssh/id_ecdsa.pub
-.It Pa ~/.ssh/id_ecdsa_sk.pub
 .It Pa ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub
-.It Pa ~/.ssh/id_ed25519_sk.pub
 .It Pa ~/.ssh/id_mldsa44_ed25519.pub
 .It Pa ~/.ssh/id_rsa.pub
 Contains the public key for authentication.
